{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（19日）早上11時23分，警方接報指，尖沙咀文化中心發生火警，一名20多歲女職員面部及手臂燒傷。消防到場動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，約15分鐘後將火救熄；傷者經由救護車送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。人員正調查起火原因。</p><p>傷者送院時，救護員為她的面部及頭部敷上敷料。</p><figure><img alt=\"尖沙咀文化中心發生火警，一名20多歲女職員面部及手臂燒傷。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188823113979400192713496.jpeg/-n6YGRSPNAovZXYmXvGtMgII0qe-AnnIsp88oJifPKA\"/><figcaption>尖沙咀文化中心發生火警，一名20多歲女職員面部及手臂燒傷。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救護員為傷者面部及頭部敷上敷料。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188823111240388608529671.jpeg/Y3zEqq0Y30h_8z0-elRsh5T3inp3SP0QbOamo0bmpqM\"/><figcaption>救護員為傷者面部及頭部敷上敷料。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一名20多歲女職員面部及手臂燒傷送院治理。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261019/1188823108539125760816590.jpeg/LhEXzaLijBwAzTmrfu7yzW5rO4a6z85WxAdzXu4Hc14\"/><figcaption>一名20多歲女職員面部及手臂燒傷送院治理。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T04:19:07.522652+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":218,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T04:12:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T04:17:34.903130+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T04:17:34.903130+00:00","content_hash":"1bcc182251f6ef2172045b46a5fab80fd8e1d54eccce333cc976d9358b9a9020","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}